                                "sense_id": "55a6f68c-f7ce-3ec5-8330-506624d3cbc6",
                                "text": "After the coroner is informed, it's virtually impossible to uninform him!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "62fa45c4-2ced-429b-bf52-52238afcb039",
                                "sense_id": "55a6f68c-f7ce-3ec5-8330-506624d3cbc6",
                                "text": "Another characteristic of the subject is the educability, that is, to uninform and to exclude."
                            },
                            {
