                                "sense_id": "55a6f68c-f7ce-3ec5-8330-506624d3cbc6",
                                "text": "She jotted a note on her clipboard. “I'm pretty sure it's nothing.” “Most lumps are just thick tissue,” she explained. “But we have to be sure. Because you informed me, we're required to schedule an ultrasound.” “Is there a way to uninform you?” I asked."
